  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Exanp kod, chema JSON, ek model politik lizib-pou-masinn gen lisans anba Lisans MIT sof si endike diferaman. To kapav deploy zot lor to prop sit gratis.",
