  "Commercial use requires contact": "Lizaz komersyal bizin kontakte nou",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Komisione apre Somet Sekirite AI Bletchley e dirize par Yoshua Bengio avek plis ki 100 lexper ki finn kontribye sorti dan prèske 30 pei plis Nasion-Zini, OECD ek Linyon Eropeen, sa rapor endepandan-la sintetiz prev syantifik aktyel lor kapasite ek risk AI davangard — remarke ki serten sistem kapav aster detekte kan pe evalie zot e aziste zot konportman an konsekans.",
  "Companion media": "Medya konpanyon",
