  "Correct positioning: independent research drafts, protocol proposals, and an open specification experiment.": "Pozisionman korek: brouyon letid endepandan, proposision protokol, ek enn lexperyans spesifikasion ouver.",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Belgium (BE) now maps to Dutch instead of French — Flemish speakers are the country’s majority (~60%) over Walloon French speakers (~40%).": "Korize enn valer par-defo pli boner: Belzik (BE) aster asosye avek Olande olie Franse — bann ki koz Flaman se lamazorite dan pei-la (~60%) kont bann ki koz Franse Valon (~40%).",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Kazakhstan (KZ) now maps to Kazakh instead of Russian, now that a Kazakh translation exists — the same kind of fix as the earlier Belgium correction.": "Korize enn valer par-defo pli boner: Kazakstan (KZ) aster asosye avek Kazak olie Ris, aster ki enn tradiksion Kazak existe — mem tip korexion ki korexion Belzik pli boner.",
  "Could AI Be Conscious?": "Could AI Be Conscious?",
  "Crawler access rules": "Regleman aksè crawler",
