  "What AI systems may do with content: read, summarize, transform, retrieve, train, commercialize, redistribute. The AICR ruleset and the AICL licensing layer make these rights declarable and transactable.": "Seki sistem AI kapav fer avek konteni: lir, rezime, transform, rekipere, antrenn, komersyaliz, redistribye. Regleman AICR ek kouch lisans AICL fer sa bann drwa-la posib pou deklare ek fer transaksion.",
